sprouted grain bagels.

00:52:07.524 --> 00:52:11.027
And, of course, they come
with a cream cheese spread.

00:52:11.027 --> 00:52:15.765
So, I've got this shrimp
avocado salad wrap.

00:52:15.765 --> 00:52:17.968
Konsai chicken salad wrap.

00:52:17.968 --> 00:52:21.304
So it's a root vegetable
chicken salad wrap.

00:52:21.304 --> 00:52:24.141
Pepper, ham, and onion focaccia.

00:52:24.141 --> 00:52:27.377
So it's a pepper, ham, and onion focaccia.

00:52:27.377 --> 00:52:31.515
They've got Caesar chicken focaccia.

00:52:31.515 --> 00:52:34.918
Grilled vegetable and soybeans hambagu.

00:52:34.918 --> 00:52:38.155
Hambagu is like hamburger beef patty.

00:52:40.390 --> 00:52:43.593
Nice combination! I didn't expect that.

00:52:43.593 --> 00:52:45.729
So, let's go to the next one.

00:52:45.729 --> 00:52:47.097
Egg sandwiches.

00:52:47.097 --> 00:52:49.533
Pork patty and English muffin.

00:52:49.533 --> 00:52:51.268
Egg and ham sandwich.

00:52:52.502 --> 00:52:54.437
Ooh!

00:52:54.437 --> 00:52:56.339
Sandwich.

00:52:56.339 --> 00:52:59.309
It's got chicken, tomato sauce.

00:52:59.309 --> 00:53:01.645
Smells nice.

00:53:01.645 --> 00:53:03.446
And next one!

00:53:03.446 --> 00:53:05.615
Ooh!

00:53:05.615 --> 00:53:07.984
Big sausage.

00:53:07.984 --> 00:53:09.586
[laughs]

00:53:09.586 --> 00:53:12.055
We got the crispy grilled cheese.

00:53:12.055 --> 00:53:12.889
Should I even open it?

00:53:12.889 --> 00:53:13.990
It's just grilled cheese, right?

00:53:13.990 --> 00:53:15.625
Bread and cheese, you get it.

00:53:15.625 --> 00:53:18.662
The tomato mozzarella panini.

00:53:18.662 --> 00:53:20.063
Turkey pesto sandwich.

00:53:20.063 --> 00:53:22.399
[drumroll]

00:53:22.399 --> 00:53:24.434
Are we happy I did that?

00:53:24.434 --> 00:53:26.069
Ham and Swiss panini.

00:53:26.069 --> 00:53:28.104
Oh, the chicken caprese panini.

00:53:28.104 --> 00:53:30.707
Yeah! Now we're talking! Yeah.

00:53:30.707 --> 00:53:32.075
That's right. Got the Italian flag

00:53:32.075 --> 00:53:33.543
