00:53:33.543 --> 00:53:36.813
This one is the chicken bacon panini.

00:53:36.813 --> 00:53:38.648
Let's open it up!

00:53:38.648 --> 00:53:39.482
Whoa!

00:53:39.482 --> 00:53:41.985
You can also get yourself protein boxes.

00:53:41.985 --> 00:53:42.953
There's a bunch of them.

00:53:42.953 --> 00:53:44.054
The one I went to didn't have any.

00:53:44.054 --> 00:53:46.923
You can also get a chicken
and quinoa protein bowl.

00:53:46.923 --> 00:53:49.859
So, here we've got baked goods.

00:53:49.859 --> 00:53:51.828
All right, so let's start with this one.

00:53:51.828 --> 00:53:53.463
It's a biscuit.

00:53:53.463 --> 00:53:57.867
We've got this waffle,
which really looks great.

00:53:57.867 --> 00:54:02.205
This cute strawberry cake pop.

00:54:02.205 --> 00:54:03.840
It's just like art!

00:54:04.874 --> 00:54:08.445
Red bean paste and butter.

00:54:08.445 --> 00:54:12.315
Red bean is really popular in Japan.

00:54:12.315 --> 00:54:13.717
I know it's kind of strange,

00:54:13.717 --> 00:54:17.621
but when you come to
Japan, please try this.

00:54:17.621 --> 00:54:18.688
All right, next one!

00:54:18.688 --> 00:54:22.125
We've got this matcha cake,

00:54:22.125 --> 00:54:24.461
which looks very beautiful.

00:54:24.461 --> 00:54:27.664
It makes me want to
post this on Instagram.

00:54:27.664 --> 00:54:30.033
Lemon cake, also looks great.

00:54:30.033 --> 00:54:32.535
This chocolate scone

00:54:32.535 --> 00:54:34.971
and tea scone.

00:54:34.971 --> 00:54:38.041
Are you going to put Harry's face on this?

00:54:38.041 --> 00:54:39.643
Hello, Harry!

00:54:39.643 --> 00:54:43.513
And next one, we've got baked cheese tart.

00:54:43.513 --> 00:54:46.683
This is so cute. Look how small it is.

00:54:46.683 --> 00:54:49.185
Cake pops? Yeah, their cake pops are big.

00:54:49.185 --> 00:54:50.086
Ours are tiny.

00:54:50.086 --> 00:54:51.621
Double chocolate brownie.

00:54:51.621 --> 00:54:53.356
Chocolate chip cookie.

00:54:53.356 --> 00:54:54.958
And although they're pretty popular,

00:54:54.958 --> 00:54:56.159
