00:54:56.159 --> 00:54:58.461
You can get yourself a
marshmallow Dream Bar.

00:54:58.461 --> 00:55:00.363
Croissants.

00:55:00.363 --> 00:55:01.598
♪ Croissants! ♪

00:55:01.598 --> 00:55:03.233
Almond croissant.

00:55:03.233 --> 00:55:04.734
Butter croissant.

00:55:04.734 --> 00:55:06.136
Here we go.

00:55:06.136 --> 00:55:07.537
Chocolate croissant.

00:55:09.639 --> 00:55:10.674
Ham and Swiss croissant.

00:55:10.674 --> 00:55:12.842
Loaves and cakes!

00:55:12.842 --> 00:55:14.344
Banana nut loaf.

00:55:14.344 --> 00:55:16.179
This is the pumpkin loaf.

00:55:16.179 --> 00:55:17.847
Cinnamon coffee cake.

00:55:17.847 --> 00:55:19.649
So, we've got the iced lemon loaf.

00:55:19.649 --> 00:55:20.684
Cheese Danish.

00:55:20.684 --> 00:55:22.452
Blueberry muffin.

00:55:22.452 --> 00:55:25.488
And, of course, blueberry scone.

00:55:25.488 --> 00:55:26.990
Can we get Harry's face on that?

00:55:28.058 --> 00:55:31.061
So, here we've got packaged foods.

00:55:31.061 --> 00:55:34.431
So, this one is avocado
cream cheese tortilla chips.

00:55:37.701 --> 00:55:40.704
I will definitely get this with beer.

00:55:40.704 --> 00:55:42.605
Not coffee. I need beer.

00:55:43.573 --> 00:55:45.075
Let's go to the next one!

00:55:45.075 --> 00:55:47.644
In Japanese, we say "bamkuhen."

00:55:47.644 --> 00:55:49.079
But this is German, right?

00:55:49.079 --> 00:55:50.980
Baumkuchen? Baumkuchen?

00:55:50.980 --> 00:55:52.215
Danke schoen!

00:55:52.215 --> 00:55:56.319
But I'm curious, this matcha baumkuchen.

00:55:57.954 --> 00:55:59.022
Mm!

00:55:59.022 --> 00:56:00.990
Ooh!

00:56:00.990 --> 00:56:03.360
It has really strong matcha flavor.

00:56:03.360 --> 00:56:04.594
I love this.

00:56:04.594 --> 00:56:05.495
Wow.

00:56:05.495 --> 00:56:07.731
Thank you for coming into my life!

00:56:07.731 --> 00:56:11.835
Chocolate and nut protein bar.

00:56:11.835 --> 00:56:16.639
And this one is cheese
and fruits protein bar.

00:56:16.639 --> 00:56:19.242
If you take a bite, you're gonna be ...

00:56:20.310 --> 00:56:21.945
ah!

00:56:21.945 --> 00:56:23.880
So, we've got this

00:56:23.880 --> 00:56:27.350
yogurt and banana granola.

00:56:27.350 --> 00:56:29.386
This one right here is

00:56:29.386 --> 00:56:32.756
