00:56:32.756 --> 00:56:36.793
[granola rustling]

00:56:38.228 --> 00:56:39.062
What do we got here?

00:56:39.062 --> 00:56:41.264
They got their barbecue chips.

00:56:42.499 --> 00:56:44.701
Hippeas organic chickpeas.

00:56:46.035 --> 00:56:47.237
Popcorn.

00:56:49.572 --> 00:56:50.874
[crashes] Yes.

00:56:50.874 --> 00:56:52.242
Organic fruit puree.

00:56:52.242 --> 00:56:54.344
Just eat the fruit that grew on the tree.

00:56:54.344 --> 00:56:56.012
You gotta put it in plastic first?

00:56:56.012 --> 00:56:57.480
Almonds.

00:56:57.480 --> 00:57:00.383
Ooh, chocolate-covered espresso beans!

00:57:00.383 --> 00:57:01.718
Biscottis!

00:57:01.718 --> 00:57:02.719
Madeleines.

00:57:02.719 --> 00:57:05.889
And sweet potato chips.

00:57:05.889 --> 00:57:06.823
If that wasn't enough,

00:57:06.823 --> 00:57:09.492
