01:42:03.584 --> 01:42:05.486
This is "Food Wars."

01:42:08.956 --> 01:42:11.592
In Japan, Taco Bell's standard tacos

01:42:11.592 --> 01:42:14.094
come in orders of one,

01:42:14.094 --> 01:42:18.665
