01:42:18.665 --> 01:42:22.069
or you can get five-pack,

01:42:22.069 --> 01:42:25.305
or you can get 10-pack.

01:42:25.305 --> 01:42:27.040
In the US, our standard Taco Bell tacos

01:42:27.040 --> 01:42:28.709
come in orders of one,

01:42:28.709 --> 01:42:30.110
three with a medium drink,

01:42:30.110 --> 01:42:34.448
or this, the 12-taco party pack.

01:42:34.448 --> 01:42:36.049
Check this out.

01:42:36.049 --> 01:42:37.551
