01:42:42.623 --> 01:42:45.359
So, this is a Beef Taco Supreme.

01:42:45.359 --> 01:42:47.060
It measures 5 inches.

01:42:47.060 --> 01:42:47.961
Our Beef Taco Supreme

01:42:47.961 --> 01:42:50.130
that's falling apart 'cause I'm an idiot

01:42:50.130 --> 01:42:54.368
