01:42:57.704 --> 01:42:59.206
Boom!

01:42:59.206 --> 01:43:01.808
It weighs 100 grams.

01:43:01.808 --> 01:43:03.810
Looks like about 120 grams.

01:43:03.810 --> 01:43:07.481
And this one is our burrito in Japan.

01:43:07.481 --> 01:43:08.949
Now let's measure it.

01:43:08.949 --> 01:43:10.384
5 inches.

01:43:10.384 --> 01:43:12.386
Our bean burrito is

01:43:12.386 --> 01:43:16.356
6 3/8 inches long.

01:43:16.356 --> 01:43:18.525
And it weighs ...

01:43:18.525 --> 01:43:19.493
guh!

01:43:19.493 --> 01:43:21.929
It weighs 220 grams.

01:43:21.929 --> 01:43:24.898
Just a hair over 250 grams.

01:43:24.898 --> 01:43:27.634
Yeah, ours weighs more!

01:43:27.634 --> 01:43:29.603
Hooray!

01:43:29.603 --> 01:43:32.339
Here's our Crunchwrap Supreme.

01:43:32.339 --> 01:43:35.175
It measures 6 inches across.

01:43:35.175 --> 01:43:37.511
Let's go. Boom!

01:43:37.511 --> 01:43:40.380
It weighs exactly 250 grams.

01:43:40.380 --> 01:43:43.517
A personal favorite,
the Crunchwrap Supr --

01:43:43.517 --> 01:43:45.085
oh, man!

01:43:45.085 --> 01:43:47.354
Aww, guys!

01:43:47.354 --> 01:43:48.855
I mean, you get the idea, but it's just,

01:43:48.855 --> 01:43:49.990
it's just like a thing of beauty

01:43:49.990 --> 01:43:52.092
when they have the whole
thing folded properly.

01:43:52.092 --> 01:43:54.294
Plus also now, all my ...

01:43:54.294 --> 01:43:55.762
everything inside's kind of exposed.

01:43:55.762 --> 01:43:59.433
Across, it's exactly

01:43:59.433 --> 01:44:01.268
6 inches.

01:44:01.268 --> 01:44:02.135
Eh?

01:44:02.135 --> 01:44:03.837
Illuminati stuff coming at you.

01:44:03.837 --> 01:44:05.906
Six sides, 6 inches.

01:44:08.175 --> 01:44:09.876
Oh, [beep].

01:44:09.876 --> 01:44:12.546
We're on to them. Here they come.

01:44:12.546 --> 01:44:14.014
If we go point to point,

01:44:14.014 --> 01:44:18.819
it is the less interesting 6 1/2 inches.

01:44:18.819 --> 01:44:20.120
So, we'll weigh it.

01:44:21.521 --> 01:44:23.056
You have no idea how bad

01:44:23.056 --> 01:44:25.158
I just want to take a huge
bite out of this thing.

01:44:25.158 --> 01:44:28.428
It weighs a respectable 300 grams.

01:44:28.428 --> 01:44:30.764
That to me sounds exactly right.

01:44:30.764 --> 01:44:32.633
At the Japanese Taco Bell,

01:44:32.633 --> 01:44:35.135
the biggest menu item is ...

01:44:35.135 --> 01:44:37.871
[drumroll]

01:44:37.871 --> 01:44:39.273
Boom!

01:44:39.273 --> 01:44:41.208
The variety set pack.

01:44:41.208 --> 01:44:45.245
It includes two grilled
burritos, which is chicken,

01:44:45.245 --> 01:44:47.180
and two Chickstars,

01:44:47.180 --> 01:44:50.350
which is fried-chicken Crunchwrap Supreme,

01:44:50.350 --> 01:44:54.121
