01:45:49.476 --> 01:45:51.945
And here's everything you
can get at a US Taco Bell

01:45:51.945 --> 01:45:53.613
you can't get in Japan.

01:45:53.613 --> 01:45:56.450
Probably. I'm very confused.

01:45:56.450 --> 01:45:58.352
