01:45:58.352 --> 01:46:01.388
So, these are Japan's special menu items.

01:46:01.388 --> 01:46:03.190
But before we get it started,

01:46:03.190 --> 01:46:04.691
I gotta mention one thing.

01:46:04.691 --> 01:46:09.696
