02:08:04.376 --> 02:08:05.778
First up,

02:08:05.778 --> 02:08:07.479
pumpkin pie.

02:08:08.881 --> 02:08:09.882
Yo!

02:08:09.882 --> 02:08:11.617
This tastes exactly like pumpkin pie.

02:08:11.617 --> 02:08:13.385
Yeah, they hit it out of
the park with that one, wow.

02:08:13.385 --> 02:08:15.187
Key lime pie.

02:08:16.455 --> 02:08:17.289
This one's so good.

02:08:17.289 --> 02:08:18.624
It tastes just like key lime pie.

02:08:18.624 --> 02:08:20.359
These are both fantastic.

02:08:20.359 --> 02:08:21.760
Fruity cereal.

02:08:24.496 --> 02:08:25.698
What cereal is this?

02:08:25.698 --> 02:08:26.932
Is that Froot Loops?

02:08:26.932 --> 02:08:28.333
Tastes exactly like Froot Loops.

02:08:28.333 --> 02:08:29.435
Gingerbread.

02:08:31.203 --> 02:08:32.738
Raspberry creme.

02:08:33.906 --> 02:08:34.740
I love this one.

02:08:34.740 --> 02:08:35.607
Yo, Joe,

02:08:35.607 --> 02:08:36.942
Yuelei.

02:08:36.942 --> 02:08:38.010
All right, try it, let's go.

02:08:38.010 --> 02:08:38.844
What do you guys think?

02:08:39.978 --> 02:08:41.814
Yeah, yeah, Starbursts, good call.

02:08:41.814 --> 02:08:43.048
Witch's brew?

02:08:43.048 --> 02:08:45.718
"Crispy wafers and
marshmallow flavored cream."

02:08:46.752 --> 02:08:47.586
These are great.

02:08:47.586 --> 02:08:50.289
Yeah, it has, like, a
