04:07:06.845 --> 04:07:10.515
and it comes in a
container that will be here

04:07:10.515 --> 04:07:12.818
until the sun explodes.

04:07:12.818 --> 04:07:15.453
This, I mean, this has to be an LA thing.

04:07:15.453 --> 04:07:16.822
You can get mango with

04:07:16.822 --> 04:07:18.490
tajin seasoning.
Automated voice: Tajin.

04:07:18.490 --> 04:07:19.891
Fantastic combination.

04:07:19.891 --> 04:07:21.359
Finally, grape cup.

04:07:21.359 --> 04:07:25.697
7-Eleven also has its own
brand of packaged candies.

04:07:25.697 --> 04:07:27.265
Sour gummy bears,

04:07:27.265 --> 04:07:29.668
sour neon gummy worms,

04:07:29.668 --> 04:07:31.570
sour watermelon wedges,

04:07:31.570 --> 04:07:33.338
green apple rings,

04:07:33.338 --> 04:07:36.842
gummy worms for catching gummy fish.

04:07:36.842 --> 04:07:38.109
Heh-heh. You like that?

04:07:38.109 --> 04:07:39.878
Fruit leather, whatever we call this.

04:07:39.878 --> 04:07:41.713
Chili mango. Hell yeah, I'm trying these.

04:07:41.713 --> 04:07:42.681
Sweetened mango,

04:07:42.681 --> 04:07:45.383
and a sweetened fruit medley.

04:07:47.786 --> 04:07:50.422
Not bad. Oh, a little
spicier that I thought, whoa.

04:07:50.422 --> 04:07:52.891
There's also gummy bears and gummy sharks.

04:07:52.891 --> 04:07:54.326
There's also gummy peach rings.

04:07:54.326 --> 04:07:55.460
They got jelly beans,

04:07:55.460 --> 04:07:57.462
and they got sour cherries.

04:07:57.462 --> 04:07:59.097
7-Eleven Selects in the US also has

04:07:59.097 --> 04:08:02.968
