04:08:02.968 --> 04:08:06.037
Vanilla, pumpkin spice,

04:08:06.037 --> 04:08:08.073
double chocolate, peppermint,

04:08:08.073 --> 04:08:10.308
s'mores, the duplexes,

04:08:10.308 --> 04:08:11.509
lemon crème.

04:08:11.509 --> 04:08:12.677
Mm-mm-mm.

04:08:12.677 --> 04:08:15.180
So, here are Japanese sweets.

04:08:15.180 --> 04:08:18.750
Pink rice cake with red bean paste.

04:08:18.750 --> 04:08:22.187
So basically it's like
cherry blossom mochi.

04:08:22.187 --> 04:08:23.288
Itadakimasu.

04:08:26.524 --> 04:08:28.827
Mm, mm.

04:08:28.827 --> 04:08:32.731
I want to eat this under
the tree of cherry blossom.

04:08:32.731 --> 04:08:35.500
Cherry blossom, pew.

04:08:38.470 --> 04:08:41.239
Next, we have ninja gummy.

04:08:41.239 --> 04:08:43.875
He's like ninja salaryman.

04:08:43.875 --> 04:08:45.944
So, it's a hard gummy.

04:08:47.746 --> 04:08:50.382
It's really tough, like stones.

04:08:50.382 --> 04:08:52.384
[crunching]

04:08:52.384 --> 04:08:53.652
Toppo.

04:08:53.652 --> 04:08:57.255
It's like Pocky, but
the chocolate is inside.

04:08:58.256 --> 04:08:59.457
I'm loving it.

04:08:59.457 --> 04:09:01.626
Look at this cute guy!

04:09:01.626 --> 04:09:03.561
Koala no Machi.

04:09:03.561 --> 04:09:06.598
Koala's March Chocolate.

04:09:06.598 --> 04:09:09.134
My favorite would be this one.

04:09:09.134 --> 04:09:13.071
When I was a kid, I would
eat this every single day.

04:09:13.071 --> 04:09:15.974
And this taste is so nostalgic.

04:09:15.974 --> 04:09:18.743
Oh, little George is calling me like,

04:09:18.743 --> 04:09:20.612
"Hey, I wanna eat this! I wanna eat -- "

04:09:20.612 --> 04:09:23.548
Hey! We are filming right now.

04:09:23.548 --> 04:09:25.817
Later, after shooting, OK?

04:09:25.817 --> 04:09:26.651
"OK."

04:09:26.651 --> 04:09:28.720
OK. We're good.

04:09:28.720 --> 04:09:30.121
Pudding.

04:09:30.121 --> 04:09:31.856
Please prepare the plate.

04:09:31.856 --> 04:09:33.658
And you just do like this.

04:09:33.658 --> 04:09:35.927
One, two, three, go.

04:09:36.861 --> 04:09:38.797
The shape is like cherry blossom.

04:09:38.797 --> 04:09:40.231
Look how jelly it is.

04:09:44.936 --> 04:09:46.104
Mm!

04:09:46.104 --> 04:09:48.573
This is the best pudding ever.

04:09:48.573 --> 04:09:50.976
We had to go on a run to get more stuff.

04:09:50.976 --> 04:09:53.812
That's why visually this
all doesn't connect.

04:09:53.812 --> 04:09:56.848
7-Eleven's got macarons, French macarons.

04:09:56.848 --> 04:09:58.783
Ooh, mini cheesecakes,

04:09:58.783 --> 04:10:01.486
New York style and strawberry swirl.

04:10:01.486 --> 04:10:02.821
These I can get behind.

04:10:02.821 --> 04:10:04.723
Our 7-Eleven in the US has ice cream,

04:10:04.723 --> 04:10:07.859
such as banana cream pie,
caramel butter pecan,

04:10:07.859 --> 04:10:10.428
chocolate-covered strawberry,
double cookie dough,

04:10:10.428 --> 04:10:12.597
cookies 'n' cream, sea-salt caramel,

04:10:12.597 --> 04:10:14.899
strawberry-banana shortcake.

04:10:14.899 --> 04:10:16.768
So, let's start with cold stuff.

04:10:16.768 --> 04:10:20.071
We've got fried dumplings. It's frozen.

04:10:20.071 --> 04:10:22.240
Frozen takoyaki,

04:10:22.240 --> 04:10:24.476
frozen fried rice.

04:10:24.476 --> 04:10:28.947
So, after these frozen
meals, I got ice cream.

04:10:28.947 --> 04:10:30.615
Choco Monaka Jumbo.

04:10:30.615 --> 04:10:31.750
So, Choco Monaka Jumbo

04:10:31.750 --> 04:10:34.619
is like Japanese ice cream sandwich.

04:10:34.619 --> 04:10:37.288
Ah!

04:10:37.288 --> 04:10:38.790
Let me bite. Itadakimasu.

04:10:42.227 --> 04:10:44.162
Sorry, it looks gross. [laughs]

04:10:44.162 --> 04:10:45.397
So it's got ice cream,

04:10:45.397 --> 04:10:47.298
and it's got chocolate in the middle,

04:10:47.298 --> 04:10:50.035
and this crunchy on the outside.

04:10:50.035 --> 04:10:52.237
Every Japanese people get this one

04:10:52.237 --> 04:10:54.506
at least once in their life.

04:10:54.506 --> 04:10:56.841
And last ice cream, I got this one.

04:10:56.841 --> 04:10:59.377
Gorilla chocolate ice cream. [laughs]

04:10:59.377 --> 04:11:00.812
I don't know what this is.

04:11:00.812 --> 04:11:02.714
Ah.

04:11:02.714 --> 04:11:06.851
Ah! Ch-t-t-t-t-t-t-t-t-t-t-t-t-t-t-t-t!

04:11:06.851 --> 04:11:10.221
Ah, sorry! Itadakimasu!

04:11:12.190 --> 04:11:13.625
This is delicious.

04:11:13.625 --> 04:11:17.262
Not only me, but Gorilla would love this.

04:11:17.262 --> 04:11:18.963
Lot of exclusive drinks.

04:11:18.963 --> 04:11:19.964
I don't know really where to begin,

04:11:19.964 --> 04:11:23.535
