04:11:37.148 --> 04:11:39.417
After that, we got these
prepackaged juices.

04:11:39.417 --> 04:11:43.588
These are the 7-Select Farmer's Grove.

04:11:43.588 --> 04:11:45.890
Cranberry cocktail, raspberry lemonade,

04:11:45.890 --> 04:11:48.960
