04:11:48.960 --> 04:11:50.295
Then next up in the bigger ones

04:11:50.295 --> 04:11:53.231
we have the 7-Eleven teas.

04:11:53.231 --> 04:11:55.100
Peach black tea, sweet tea.

04:11:55.100 --> 04:11:56.468
They weren't kidding, man, look at that.

04:11:56.468 --> 04:11:57.869
Lemon sweet tea

04:11:57.869 --> 04:11:59.971
