04:11:59.971 --> 04:12:02.307
Fruit punch, mango, guava.

04:12:02.307 --> 04:12:05.477
Energy, come on, herbal tonic.

04:12:05.477 --> 04:12:07.078
Herbal? This is herbal, guys? Yeah?

04:12:07.078 --> 04:12:09.481
7-Eleven also their own brand of ...

04:12:09.481 --> 04:12:11.483
are these considered energy drinks?

04:12:11.483 --> 04:12:13.118
The Gatorades and Powerades and the like.

04:12:13.118 --> 04:12:15.220
So Replenish, and of
course Replenish zero.

04:12:15.220 --> 04:12:17.388
